name=Delirium Fix
id=DelFix
require=\BB_CommonSense
loadModAfter=\83gmcGseriesVans
poster=poster.png
description=Small fixes and compatibility patches for the Delirium server. Common Sense (BB_CommonSense): CleanBandageWithAlcohol recipe fixed for B42.14+ (Alcohol fluid renamed to RubbingAlcohol; the old name stopped the server from loading), B42 fixing scripts, MP-synced crowbar prying of doors and vehicles, fuel menus, item collecting, Lua error guards. Based on Common Sense Patch by FeedeameEsta; Common Sense by BitBraven. Ammo Maker (optional): sandbox option DelFix.AmmoMakerDropCasings to stop casings dropping on the ground, stale casing clean-up records removed. 83 GMC G-Series Vans (optional): purple paint added to the G1500 van. Vanilla farming: the last stage before a crop rots lasts 10 times longer (sandbox DelFix.FarmingRotTimeMultiplier), for plants reaching it after install. Load after Common Sense and the vans. Build 42.
tags=Build 42
versionMin=42.13
